## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-09-29. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### EXP Damage Dealer (EXP)

- Items: Tough Boots, Blade of the Heptaseas, War Axe, Endless Battle, Malefic Roar, Immortality
- Core: Blade of the Heptaseas, War Axe, Endless Battle
- Emblem: Fighter Emblem with Firmness, Festival of Blood, Brave Smite
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Warrior Boots over Tough Boots when Use against full-physical lineups with no hard crowd control where armor value matters more than CC reduction.; Sea Halberd over Malefic Roar when Use when the enemy has a healer, shield support, or high-HP fighter keeping the kick target alive through the burst.; Oracle over Immortality when Use when fights are frequent and Oracle's Bless passive, which raises the shields and HP regen you receive by 25%, keeps you in the fight longer than a revive.; Radiant Armor over Malefic Roar when Use against triple-magic-damage comps where stacked Magic Defense from Radiant Armor stacks prevents you from being burst before the combo lands.
- Total cost: 11260 gold

Default EXP setup for solo queue. Heptaseas rush into War Axe gives enough burst to kill a squishy from fog. Endless Battle's Divine Justice true damage fires off every skill cast during the combo chain.

### Tank Roam (Roam)

- Items: Tough Boots, Dominance Ice, Athena's Shield, Antique Cuirass, Queen's Wings, Immortality
- Core: Dominance Ice, Athena's Shield, Antique Cuirass
- Emblem: Tank Emblem with Vitality, Tenacity, Concussive Blast
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Blessing: Conceal
- Flex: Brute Force Breastplate over Antique Cuirass when Use when the enemy physical threat is split across multiple sources and you need the stacking CC reduction and adaptive attack rather than single-source Deter debuff.; Oracle over Athena's Shield when Use when magic damage is sustained poke rather than one-shot burst, and you have a healer support whose shields and heals on you are raised by 25% through Oracle's Bless passive.; Radiant Armor over Queen's Wings when Use against repeated magic damage from mages like Chang'e or Gord where Radiant Armor stacks outvalue Queen's Wings burst protection.
- Total cost: 11400 gold

Competitive and high-rank setup where Chou plays as a pick-focused roamer. Conceal is the income engine (Thriving replaces the minion gold and EXP he gives up) and its invisibility plus movement speed walks the whole team into kick range before the target can react. He still kicks to deliver, but the tank items let him survive the approach and kick twice per extended fight. Concussive Blast adds HP-scaling AOE damage on the passive auto.

### Hybrid EXP Bruiser (EXP)

- Items: Tough Boots, Blade of the Heptaseas, War Axe, Brute Force Breastplate, Malefic Roar, Immortality
- Core: Blade of the Heptaseas, War Axe, Brute Force Breastplate
- Emblem: Fighter Emblem with Firmness, Festival of Blood, Brave Smite
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Endless Battle over Brute Force Breastplate when Use when your team already has a tanky frontliner and you can commit to the full damage combo without needing the extra durability.; Dominance Ice over Malefic Roar when Use when the enemy jungler or marksman relies on attack speed and lifesteal to win fights, and your kick plus the anti-heal aura shuts them down.; Sea Halberd over Malefic Roar when Use when anti-heal is mandatory on your physical slot and the enemy front line has not yet stacked enough armor to justify penetration.; Radiant Armor over Malefic Roar when Use against teams with multiple magic-damage threats where you need to survive the approach before the kick connects.
- Total cost: 10800 gold

Balanced setup for drafts where the enemy has one priority kick target but enough dive threat to punish full-damage Chou. Brute Force Breastplate adds stacking CC reduction, adaptive attack, and movement speed per second of combat, which stacks with Tough Boots to make Chou nearly CC-immune during extended fights.

